WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.626 --> 00:00:02.711
I'm home.

00:00:03.545 --> 00:00:04.963
You won't believe this.

00:00:05.463 --> 00:00:07.382
I got fired again.

00:00:08.008 --> 00:00:09.342
Terrible, right?

00:00:10.468 --> 00:00:11.302
Terrible...

00:00:14.222 --> 00:00:16.016
What did you do?

00:00:16.516 --> 00:00:19.477
How did you clean before?

00:00:19.978 --> 00:00:22.147
The maid did that kind of stuff for me.

00:00:24.649 --> 00:00:25.817
Is it true?

00:00:28.153 --> 00:00:29.487
Wow, it's a mansion!

00:00:30.822 --> 00:00:33.992
-The neighbors' houses all look like this.
-Are you

00:00:34.325 --> 00:00:35.994
a rich kid?

00:00:36.036 --> 00:00:37.829
No! Not at all!

00:00:38.371 --> 00:00:40.373
How much of an allowance did you get?

00:00:41.875 --> 00:00:43.543
Allowance?

00:00:44.252 --> 00:00:46.087
-I use this.
-That?

00:00:46.504 --> 00:00:49.507
A black card?
That's a no-limit credit card!

00:00:49.591 --> 00:00:50.675
Yeah. That's it.

00:00:51.051 --> 00:00:53.344
I've never seen one before.

00:00:53.386 --> 00:00:55.680
But I can't use it.

00:00:56.014 --> 00:00:57.849
They'll find out where I am.

00:00:58.600 --> 00:00:59.851
Oh, I see.

00:01:00.393 --> 00:01:02.187
You ran away from home, right?

00:01:05.690 --> 00:01:08.068
Anyway, let's clean up this room.

00:01:09.277 --> 00:01:10.111
Let's do it!

00:01:14.908 --> 00:01:16.534
We finally have room to sleep.

00:01:17.077 --> 00:01:17.911
Thanks.

00:01:23.458 --> 00:01:24.292
You know,

00:01:24.876 --> 00:01:28.880
if I go straight to sleep when
I'm having a bad day, I get nightmares.

00:01:29.881 --> 00:01:31.925
-I know what you mean.
-When that happens,

00:01:32.425 --> 00:01:35.136
I think about things I like
before going to sleep.

00:01:35.887 --> 00:01:38.598
Let's both tell each other what we like.

00:01:39.140 --> 00:01:41.893
-Okay.
-Then I'll start.

00:01:44.395 --> 00:01:45.480
Mars-yaki.

00:01:45.897 --> 00:01:48.483
-What's that?
-It's a specialty of Alba City.

00:01:48.942 --> 00:01:50.485
It's octopus, fried like an alien.

00:01:51.778 --> 00:01:53.404
Gross! I want to try it!

00:01:53.780 --> 00:01:54.614
Okay. Next.

00:01:55.323 --> 00:01:56.449
Something I like?

00:01:57.742 --> 00:01:59.244
Assam tapioca milk tea!

00:01:59.744 --> 00:02:00.829
That's so girly!

00:02:00.912 --> 00:02:01.955
Really?

00:02:02.580 --> 00:02:03.998
Timberland boots.

00:02:04.457 --> 00:02:06.126
Nice! I've never worn them before.

00:02:06.459 --> 00:02:07.836
I always wear them.

00:02:08.753 --> 00:02:09.796
The name of my guitar.

00:02:10.088 --> 00:02:10.922
Hummingbird!

00:02:11.589 --> 00:02:13.633
-That's a cute name!
-Right?

00:02:14.342 --> 00:02:17.095
The smell of the river
when I skate along the bank.

00:02:17.512 --> 00:02:18.805
-Smell?
-Yeah.

00:02:19.848 --> 00:02:20.682
Smell...

00:02:21.474 --> 00:02:22.851
The smell of a paperback book.

00:02:23.434 --> 00:02:26.104
-Paper?
-Yeah. And...

00:02:26.813 --> 00:02:28.189
Cyndi's songs.

00:02:28.773 --> 00:02:30.650
I prefer Crystal.

00:02:30.775 --> 00:02:31.651
Oh, me, too!

00:02:32.152 --> 00:02:34.612
-I like Crystal, too!
-No way! Which song?

00:02:36.322 --> 00:02:37.157
Which song was it?

00:02:38.283 --> 00:02:39.450
"Unbreakable"!

00:02:39.826 --> 00:02:43.371
That's a great song!
But I like "Everything" more!

00:02:43.454 --> 00:02:44.706
That's not fair!

00:02:44.873 --> 00:02:47.125
-What? Why?
-That's not fair!

